			(property "Description" "Qorvo DWM3001C -- fully integrated UWB transceiver module: DW3110 UWB IC + Nordic nRF52833 BLE SoC + ST LIS2DH12 accelerometer + planar UWB antenna + Bluetooth chip antenna + power management + 38.4MHz crystal, all on-module. 48-pin side-castellated, 27.1 x 19.13 x 3.2mm. VDD 2.5-3.6V (Table 4). Pin names/numbers transcribed from the real Qorvo DWM3001C Data Sheet Rev B, May 2022, Table 2 'DWM3001C Pin Functions'. Symbol layout: pins 1-24 down the left, 25-48 down the right, in numeric order. CAVEAT: pin 18 is NOT documented in Table 2 (the table lists 1-17 and 19-48 only) -- it is modelled here as a passive NC so ERC makes no assumption about it either way; confirm against the land-pattern figure before fab. DW_GPn pins go to the DW3110 transceiver; Pn.nn pins go to the nRF52833. Factory-calibrated for crystal trim (<2ppm typ), transmit power, and antenna delay (Table 1)."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
					(hide yes)
				)
			)
